  "title": {
    "zh": "DIY夜光插珠帐篷拼搭积木套装",
    "en": "DIY Glow Fort Building Block Set"
  },
  "summary": {
    "zh": "这是一款DIY夜光插珠帐篷拼搭积木套装，采用PP结构件，适用于亲子互动、课堂活动和创意搭建场景。\n\n品牌为尧顺，产地东莞，支持夜光主题展示和拆装房子类玩法。",
    "en": "This is a DIY glow fort building block set using PP structural parts, suitable for parent-child interaction, classroom activities, and creative construction scenarios.\n\nBrand: Yaoshun. Origin: Dongguan. It supports glow-themed display and detachable-house style play."
  },
  "description": {
    "zh": [
      "该款DIY夜光插珠帐篷拼搭积木套装采用模块化拼接结构，可用于帐篷、通道和互动空间等多形态搭建，适合儿童持续创意构建。",
      "产品兼顾日常拼搭与夜光氛围展示，适用于亲子互动、课程教具与活动场景，支持重复拆装和组合。",
      "包装为彩盒，彩盒尺寸43*26*11cm，杆子尺寸40cm，18孔规格结构，便于渠道上架和项目采购。"
    ],
    "en": [
      "This DIY glow fort building block set uses a modular interlocking structure and supports multiple layouts such as tents, tunnels, and interactive spaces for continuous creative construction play.",
      "It combines everyday construction play with glow visual effects and is suitable for parent-child interaction, educational props, and event scenarios, with repeatable assembly support.",
      "The set uses color-box packaging with a 43*26*11 cm box size, 40 cm rods, and an 18-hole structure specification, suitable for channel listing and project procurement."
    ]
  },
